      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "hello, sorry about the delay, do sit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.52,
      "end_seconds": 13.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.39,
      "text": "Let me think, uh, hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.47,
      "end_seconds": 17.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "what's the main thing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.38,
      "end_seconds": 37.61,
      "duration_seconds": 18.23,
      "text": "um, so... chest pain after a crash that's why I came my sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot i didn't want to bother you but it keeps coming back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.89,
      "end_seconds": 44.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.95,
      "end_seconds": 47.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "no, none"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.19,
      "end_seconds": 50.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Does anything set it off?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.91,
      "end_seconds": 55.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Yes, breathing. That makes it worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.49,
      "end_seconds": 59.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.02,
      "end_seconds": 81.83,
      "duration_seconds": 21.81,
      "text": "Um, when it starts I tend to get belly pain as well. Actually, the belly pain? That's been for two weeks. With belly pain, it feels severe to me. Difficulty breathing was there, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.91,
      "end_seconds": 89.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.26,
      "text": "Have you had chest pain after a crash before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.7,
      "end_seconds": 102.04,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "Mm, a bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.99,
      "end_seconds": 110.45,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any neck pain, head injury or loss of consciousness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.36,
      "end_seconds": 114.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.5,
      "end_seconds": 120.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.9,
      "end_seconds": 124.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "So, no, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.3,
      "end_seconds": 129.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.35,
      "end_seconds": 133.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.36,
      "end_seconds": 141.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "alright, any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.71,
      "end_seconds": 149.16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.45,
      "text": "yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.17,
      "end_seconds": 164.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.67,
      "end_seconds": 167.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Yes, depression."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.84,
      "end_seconds": 172.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "What's your work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.37,
      "end_seconds": 180.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.99,
      "end_seconds": 184.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Okay, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.7,
      "end_seconds": 188.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.36,
      "end_seconds": 204.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.08,
      "end_seconds": 210.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "Let me think, I'm allergic to wheat, I get bloating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 211.1,
      "end_seconds": 220.39,
      "duration_seconds": 9.29,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. SpO2 98 percent on room air, pulse 110, temperature is 36.6 degrees, BP is 104 over 63."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.28,
      "end_seconds": 222.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.33,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.66,
      "end_seconds": 228.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.41,
      "end_seconds": 231.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.62,
      "end_seconds": 252.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.27,
      "text": "There is bruising across the chest, the left side moves less, and the belly is tender and rigid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.7,
      "end_seconds": 272.68,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.32,
      "end_seconds": 288.2,
      "duration_seconds": 12.88,
      "text": "All finished, thank you. Taking everything into account, the most likely explanation is serious chest and abdominal injury. I'm going to order a trauma CT scan, for major trauma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.2,
      "end_seconds": 294.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "oh, you know, how long will it it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.86,
      "end_seconds": 320.75,
      "duration_seconds": 24.89,
      "text": "I want an urgent blood cross-match done, that's for trauma that will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step do not move, I am activating the trauma team now let's get you seen by the trauma team, I'll arrange the letter if the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.72,
      "end_seconds": 325.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "thank you, that's clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.5,
      "end_seconds": 332.56,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Please come and see me straight away. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.45,
      "end_seconds": 337.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.73,
      "end_seconds": 339.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
